{"seq":4,"slug":"loop-closure","title":"回环检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/autonomous-navigation/slam-fundamentals/loop-closure","wordCount":1989,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"回环检测\">回环检测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回环检测（Loop Closure Detection）是 SLAM 系统中消除累积漂移的关键技术。当机器人重新访问已探索过的区域时，回环检测通过识别这一事件，建立当前观测与历史观测之间的约束关系，从而全局校正轨迹和地图。没有回环检测的 SLAM 系统会随时间推移产生不可控的累积误差，导致地图前后不一致。</p>\n<p>回环检测的核心挑战在于：如何在大规模场景中高效、准确地判断当前位置是否曾经到访过，同时避免错误的回环匹配导致地图崩溃。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[传感器输入] --&gt; B[特征提取/描述]&#10;    B --&gt; C[候选回环检索]&#10;    C --&gt; D{几何验证}&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| E[添加回环约束]&#10;    D --&gt;|拒绝| F[继续探索]&#10;    E --&gt; G[全局图优化]&#10;    G --&gt; H[轨迹与地图校正]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[传感器输入] --&gt; B[特征提取/描述]\n    B --&gt; C[候选回环检索]\n    C --&gt; D{几何验证}\n    D --&gt;|通过| E[添加回环约束]\n    D --&gt;|拒绝| F[继续探索]\n    E --&gt; G[全局图优化]\n    G --&gt; H[轨迹与地图校正]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无回环检测</th>\n<th>有回环检测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累积误差</td>\n<td>持续增长，不可控</td>\n<td>全局校正，有界收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地图一致性</td>\n<td>前后区域不对齐</td>\n<td>全局一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>短距离、开环路径</td>\n<td>长距离、重复访问区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算开销</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等（检索+验证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鲁棒性要求</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（误检测会崩溃）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉词袋模型\">视觉词袋模型</h2><p>视觉词袋（Bag of Words, BoW）是最经典的回环检测方法，借鉴了自然语言处理中的文档检索思想。其核心是将图像中的视觉特征量化为离散的&quot;视觉单词&quot;，用单词的分布描述图像，通过比较分布的相似性判断回环。</p>\n<p>词汇树（Vocabulary Tree）的构建流程如下：首先从大量训练图像中提取局部特征描述子（如 ORB、BRIEF），然后使用层次化 K-Means 聚类将描述子空间划分为树状结构。查询时，每个特征描述子沿树逐层下降到叶节点，叶节点即为视觉单词。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.cluster import KMeans&#10;&#10;class VocabularyTree:&#10;    def __init__(self, branch_factor=10, depth=6):&#10;        self.branch_factor = branch_factor&#10;        self.depth = depth&#10;        self.nodes = {}&#10;&#10;    def build(self, descriptors, level=0, node_id=0):&#10;        if level &gt;= self.depth or len(descriptors) &lt; self.branch_factor:&#10;            self.nodes[node_id] = {&#39;leaf&#39;: True, &#39;weight&#39;: 0.0}&#10;            return&#10;&#10;        kmeans = KMeans(n_clusters=self.branch_factor, max_iter=100)&#10;        labels = kmeans.fit_predict(descriptors)&#10;        self.nodes[node_id] = {&#10;            &#39;leaf&#39;: False,&#10;            &#39;centers&#39;: kmeans.cluster_centers_&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        for i in range(self.branch_factor):&#10;            child_id = node_id * self.branch_factor + i + 1&#10;            child_desc = descriptors[labels == i]&#10;            if len(child_desc) &gt; 0:&#10;                self.build(child_desc, level + 1, child_id)&#10;&#10;    def transform(self, descriptors):&#10;        bow_vector = {}&#10;        for desc in descriptors:&#10;            word_id = self._descend(desc, 0)&#10;            bow_vector[word_id] = bow_vector.get(word_id, 0) + 1&#10;        return bow_vector&#10;&#10;    def _descend(self, descriptor, node_id):&#10;        node = self.nodes.get(node_id)&#10;        if node is None or node.get(&#39;leaf&#39;):&#10;            return node_id&#10;        centers = node[&#39;centers&#39;]&#10;        dists = np.linalg.norm(centers - descriptor, axis=1)&#10;        best = np.argmin(dists)&#10;        child_id = node_id * self.branch_factor + best + 1&#10;        return self._descend(descriptor, child_id)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VocabularyTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, branch_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.branch_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> branch_factor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, descriptors, level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(descriptors) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.branch_factor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nodes[node_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'leaf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'weight'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        kmeans </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_clusters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.branch_factor, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_iter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kmeans.fit_predict(descriptors)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nodes[node_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'leaf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'centers'</span><span style=\"color:#